WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:01.626
I am very thankful
for the NBA for

00:00:01.626 --> 00:00:03.670
giving me this huge
platform worldwide.

00:00:04.045 --> 00:00:06.756
But, if they're going
to do something

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:08.591
wrong

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:10.135
I'm going to
expose them.

00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:11.469
When should
professional athletes

00:00:11.469 --> 00:00:13.888
feel morally obligated
to put their careers

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:15.432
their personal safety

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:17.183
and their own
freedom on the line

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.269
to speak out about
political injustice?

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:20.395
Raised in Turkey,

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:21.688
Enes Kanter Freedom

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.106
decided to use his fame

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:24.816
to speak out
about the issues

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:26.026
that matter most.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.444
While we are dribbling the ball

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:29.779
on the other
side of the world,

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:31.656
people are losing
their loved ones

00:00:31.656 --> 00:00:32.157
and their lives

00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:33.742
and losing their hopes.

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:34.784
Freedom made headlines earlier

00:00:34.784 --> 00:00:36.077
this year
for criticizing

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:38.038
the National
Basketball Association

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:40.206
and its biggest stars
for their business

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.791
relationships
with China,

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:42.876
which has been accused

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.335
of violating the
civil rights

00:00:44.335 --> 00:00:45.503
of ethnic Muslims

00:00:45.503 --> 00:00:47.630
known as the Uyghurs,
and forcing them into

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:49.132
reeducation camps.

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:50.717
Reason caught up
with Freedom

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:51.176
to talk about

00:00:51.176 --> 00:00:52.218
his early
childhood

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:53.219
growing up in Turkey

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.679
as a basketball
prodigy,

00:00:54.679 --> 00:00:56.056
calls for his arrest,

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:58.725
and what's
driving his activism.

